{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人陳煒日前以辣舞衣於無綫台慶演出「炫舞女王」環節，1秒變裝的驚艷造型引起全城熱話，不少網民形容她「凍齡女皇」，紛紛點讚留言：「Keep得超好」、「氣場贏晒後生女」。</p><p>原來當晚完騷後電視城門外雲集大批粉絲準備了生日蛋榚及應援品等，冒寒苦候陳煒</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T04:22:56.983883+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T04:01:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T04:16:20.420102+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T04:16:20.420102+00:00","content_hash":"7bae973d84a4829f97f07b6946a44bc45fe0bcbe4e7e30337e7a24335587d2ef","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}